[h1]Best Armor[/h1]A lightweight [b]client-side Fabric mod[/b] that adds three prebuilt equipment shulker boxes and a Void Sword to the operator creative tab.
[h2]Overview[/h2]Best Armor adds the following dynamically generated items to the operator-only creative tab:
[list]
[*]Yellow Shulker Box[/*]
[*]Orange Shulker Box[/*]
[*]Red Shulker Box[/*]
[*]Void Sword[/*]
[/list]Items inside each shulker box are listed in their actual slot order. Every enchantment, component, and attribute is written directly under the relevant item.
[h2]Added Creative Items[/h2][h3]Yellow Shulker Box[/h3]The Yellow Shulker Box contains 27 items based on high-end enchantments obtainable in normal Survival gameplay.
